  "title": "Motor Profiler Stops at 7% and driver protection (STM32F446 + STEVAL-IPMM15B)",
  "content": "<p>Hello,</p><p>We are using STM32 Motor Profiler to identify the parameters of an IPMSM motor, but the profiling process always stops at approximately 7% and reports a “Driver Protection” fault.</p><p>Hardware configuration: - MCU board: NUCLEO-F446RE - Motor-control expansion board: X-NUCLEO-IHM09M2 - Power board: STEVAL-IPMM15B -</p><p>Motor type: IPMSM </p><p> </p><p>Thank you.</p><figure><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://uploads-eu-west-1.insided.com/stmicroelectronics-en/attachment/f81babe8-dccb-492f-ba08-ad9f5f5b9d78.png\" /></figure><p> </p>",
